================================================================================
SUMMARY OF KNOWN BUGS
================================================================================

BUG 1 — mode2_assembly.py (Trinity RAM argument)
  File:    /home/ec2-user/ChimeraTE/scripts/mode2_assembly.py, line 33
  Bad:     subprocess.call([..., '--max_memory', str(ram), + 'G', ...])
  Fixed:   subprocess.call([..., '--max_memory', str(ram) + 'G', ...])
  Fix cmd: sed -i "s/str(ram), + 'G'/str(ram) + 'G'/g" \
             /home/ec2-user/ChimeraTE/scripts/mode2_assembly.py
  Affects: Mode 2 with --assembly flag. Crashes before Trinity runs.

BUG 2 — RepeatMasker famdb.py (Broken Dfam database in container)
  File:    /opt/conda/share/RepeatMasker/famdb.py, line 264
  Error:   TypeError: 'NoneType' object is not iterable
  Cause:   The Dfam taxonomy database inside the container is outdated/corrupt.
           get_lineage_totals() returns None for accessions instead of a list.
  Result:  RepeatMasker returns empty output -> trinity_masked df has no
           'end'/'start' columns -> KeyError -> ValueError on df insert.
  Fix:     Use --ref_TEs with a direct FASTA file instead of a species name:
           --ref_TEs example_data/mode2/dmel-sampled_TE-copies.fa
           (bypasses the broken internal Dfam DB entirely)

BUG 3 — mode1_replicability.py (Empty TE-exonized dataframe)
  File:    /home/ec2-user/ChimeraTE/scripts/mode1_replicability.py, line 21
  Error:   ValueError: No objects to concatenate
  Cause:   TE-exonized_embedded found 0 results in both replicates.
           merge_dfs() tries to pd.concat() empty list -> ValueError.
  Note:    TE-initiated (1) and TE-terminated (1) completed successfully.
           This may be expected for small example data with only 6 TE families.

BUG 4 — tmpfs space (Apptainer --writable-tmpfs limit)
  Error:   OSError: [Errno 28] No space left on device
  Cause:   Default tmpfs is too small for large intermediate files.
  Fix:     Bind real disk directories to container paths:
           --bind ~/repos/neondisco-teas/data/output/index:\
             /home/ec2-user/ChimeraTE/index
           --bind ~/repos/neondisco-teas/data/output/projects:\
             /home/ec2-user/ChimeraTE/projects

